                  "type": "practice",
                  "title": "Practice: Schedule Your First Real Weekly Review",
                  "content": "Open your calendar. Find the next Friday afternoon (3:00-4:30 p.m.) OR the next Sunday evening (5:00-6:30 p.m.). Create a **recurring weekly event** for 90 minutes. Title it: **\"Weekly Review — Meeting with My CEO.\"** Set the location to a specific physical place — your home desk, a particular coffee shop, the public library. Set a 30-minute reminder. Add notes with the three-part agenda from the visual card above. Mark the event as *busy*. Tell your household or roommates that this slot is non-negotiable. **The single act of putting this on the calendar with a real name and a real location is the highest-leverage move you will make this entire course.**",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\">PRACTICE: SCHEDULE IT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\">Highest-leverage 60 seconds in the course</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#6366f1\">PICK A SLOT</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"285\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Friday 3:00-4:30 OR Sunday 5:00-6:30</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"320\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\">Same slot every week.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"360\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"420\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\">CREATE RECURRING EVENT</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"465\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Title: \"Weekly Review — Meeting With My CEO\"</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"500\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">90 minutes. Recurring weekly. Set reminder.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"540\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"600\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\">SET A LOCATION</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"645\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Home desk, café, library — somewhere distinct.</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"680\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Tell household it is non-negotiable.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"720\" width=\"940\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"780\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#f59e0b\">ATTACH THE AGENDA</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"825\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">In event notes: Get Clear / Get Current / Get Creative</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"860\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Print and pin a copy too.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"930\" width=\"900\" height=\"110\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"995\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Show up. Every week. For the rest of the course.</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Pick your slot. Name it. Defend it."
                  }
